<!--
    ModeSwitch – the two-option pill above the fields card
    (Paper "13 · Mode switch — icon on the active side", used on "1c · Setup — mode switch, 6 fields").

        ╭──────────────────────────────────────────────╮
        │ ╭───────────────────╮                        │   track  34 high, radius 17, #E8EAED, 3 px padding
        │ │ ▣  Single test    │    Multiple tests      │   thumb  28 high, radius 14, white, soft 1 px shadow
        │ ╰───────────────────╯                        │   label  13 px SemiBold: black when chosen, Muted otherwise
        ╰──────────────────────────────────────────────╯

    Anatomy, back to front (the Grid at the bottom of this file):
      1. Track ......... the grey pill.
      2. Wash .......... a very faint violet → pink → orange gradient across the whole track. It is invisible at rest
                         and breathes once (opacity only) whenever the selection changes.
      3. Thumb ......... ONE white pill shared by both options. The code-behind moves its left and right edge
                         separately, so it stretches a little on the way and settles on the chosen segment.
      4. Segments ...... two RadioButtons side by side; each is just an icon slot + a label on a transparent pill.

    One segment, left to right (style "Segment"):
      padding 14 ……… icon slot ……… label ……… padding 16
        · icon slot: closed (width 0) on the side that is not chosen; opens to 25 (page) or 35 (fan of three)
          over about a third of a second, and fades in. That width already contains the 7 px gap to the label.
        · the segment grows with the slot, and the thumb follows it frame by frame (ModeSwitch.xaml.cs).

    The two icons (both 18 high, solid, drawn here as vector paths – no image files):
      · first option  ("Single")  one page: blue gradient, pale folded corner, two white text lines
      · second option ("Multi")   the same page in front with a white rim, two paler pages behind it that fan out
                                  by 20° and 2.5 px to each side when the option is chosen
      Which icon a segment carries is decided by its Tag ("Single" / "Multi") further down.

    Motion lives in ModeSwitch.xaml.cs; everything visual is in this file. Nothing here bursts out of a point:
    the pages are full size from the first frame and only turn, the wash only changes opacity.

    Keyboard: Tab focuses the switch once, Left / Right change the side. The focus ring follows the pill shape.

    Use:  <local:ModeSwitch FirstText="Single test" SecondText="Multiple tests" SelectedIndex="{Binding Mode}" />
-->
<UserControl x:Class="Conduit.ModeSwitch"
             x:ClassModifier="internal"
             x:Name="Root"
             xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
             Height="34"
             HorizontalAlignment="Left"
             Focusable="False"
             SnapsToDevicePixels="True"
             UseLayoutRounding="True">

    <UserControl.Resources>

        <!-- Fill of the page icons: a light-to-brand blue, top to bottom. -->
        <LinearGradientBrush x:Key="PageFill" StartPoint="0,0" EndPoint="0,1">
            <GradientStop Color="#5C7FFF" Offset="0" />
            <GradientStop Color="#1F4BFF" Offset="1" />
        </LinearGradientBrush>

        <!-- Keyboard focus ring: follows the segment's pill shape. -->
        <Style x:Key="SegmentFocus">
            <Setter Property="Control.Template">
                <Setter.Value>
                    <ControlTemplate>
                        <Rectangle RadiusX="14" RadiusY="14" Stroke="{StaticResource Blue}" StrokeThickness="1.5" />
                    </ControlTemplate>
                </Setter.Value>
            </Setter>
        </Style>

        <!-- One segment: just a label on a transparent pill. The white thumb underneath is shared by both. -->
        <Style x:Key="Segment" TargetType="RadioButton">
            <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand" />
            <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{StaticResource SegmentFocus}" />
            <Setter Property="Template">
                <Setter.Value>
                    <ControlTemplate TargetType="RadioButton">
                        <Border x:Name="Hit" Height="28" Padding="14,0,16,0" CornerRadius="14" Background="Transparent">
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">

                                <!-- Icon slot: closed (Width 0) on the side that is not chosen. Tag picks the glyph. -->
                                <Border x:Name="IconSlot" Width="0" Height="18" Opacity="0" ClipToBounds="True"
                                        VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                    <Grid HorizontalAlignment="Left" VerticalAlignment="Center">

                                        <!-- Single: one solid page – blue gradient, pale folded corner, two white text lines. -->
                                        <Canvas x:Name="SingleGlyph" Width="18" Height="18">
                                            <Path Data="M6,1.5 H10.6 L14.5,5.4 V14 A2.5,2.5 0 0 1 12,16.5 H6 A2.5,2.5 0 0 1 3.5,14 V4 A2.5,2.5 0 0 1 6,1.5 Z"
                                                  Fill="{StaticResource PageFill}" />
                                            <Path Data="M10.6,1.5 V3.9 A1.5,1.5 0 0 0 12.1,5.4 H14.5 Z" Fill="#C4D0FF" />
                                            <Path Data="M6.6,9.4 H11.4 M6.6,12.4 H9.6" Stroke="White" StrokeThickness="1.5"
                                                  StrokeStartLineCap="Round" StrokeEndLineCap="Round" />
                                        </Canvas>

                                        <!--
                                            Multi: the same page in front, with a white rim, and two paler pages behind it.
                                            The two behind start hidden under the front page and fan out to the sides.
                                        -->
                                        <Canvas x:Name="MultiGlyph" Width="28" Height="18" Visibility="Collapsed">
                                            <Rectangle x:Name="FanLeft" Canvas.Left="9" Canvas.Top="3" Width="10" Height="13.5"
                                                       RadiusX="2.5" RadiusY="2.5" Fill="#B9C7FF">
                                                <Rectangle.RenderTransform>
                                                    <TransformGroup>
                                                        <RotateTransform CenterX="5" CenterY="13.5" Angle="0" />
                                                        <TranslateTransform X="0" />
                                                    </TransformGroup>
                                                </Rectangle.RenderTransform>
                                            </Rectangle>
                                            <Rectangle x:Name="FanRight" Canvas.Left="9" Canvas.Top="3" Width="10" Height="13.5"
                                                       RadiusX="2.5" RadiusY="2.5" Fill="#8FA6FF">
                                                <Rectangle.RenderTransform>
                                                    <TransformGroup>
                                                        <RotateTransform CenterX="5" CenterY="13.5" Angle="0" />
                                                        <TranslateTransform X="0" />
                                                    </TransformGroup>
                                                </Rectangle.RenderTransform>
                                            </Rectangle>
                                            <Path Data="M11.5,1.6 H15.1 L19,5.5 V14 A2.5,2.5 0 0 1 16.5,16.5 H11.5 A2.5,2.5 0 0 1 9,14 V4.1 A2.5,2.5 0 0 1 11.5,1.6 Z"
                                                  Fill="{StaticResource PageFill}" Stroke="White" StrokeThickness="1.3"
                                                  StrokeLineJoin="Round" />
                                            <Path Data="M15.1,1.9 V4 A1.5,1.5 0 0 0 16.6,5.5 H18.7 Z" Fill="#C4D0FF" />
                                            <Path Data="M11.9,9.4 H16.1 M11.9,12.3 H14.5" Stroke="White" StrokeThickness="1.5"
                                                  StrokeStartLineCap="Round" StrokeEndLineCap="Round" />
                                        </Canvas>
                                    </Grid>
                                </Border>

                                <TextBlock x:Name="Label"
                                           Text="{Binding Content, RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}}"
                                           FontFamily="{StaticResource Sans}" FontSize="13" FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                           VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                    <TextBlock.Foreground>
                                        <SolidColorBrush Color="#5B6270" /><!-- Muted -->
                                    </TextBlock.Foreground>
                                </TextBlock>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Border>
                        <ControlTemplate.Triggers>

                            <!-- Label cross-fade: muted ↔ black. -->
                            <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
                                <Trigger.EnterActions>
                                    <BeginStoryboard>
                                        <Storyboard>
                                            <ColorAnimation Storyboard.TargetName="Label"
                                                            Storyboard.TargetProperty="(TextBlock.Foreground).(SolidColorBrush.Color)"
                                                            To="#000000" Duration="0:0:0.26">
                                                <ColorAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                                    <SineEase EasingMode="EaseInOut" />
                                                </ColorAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                            </ColorAnimation>
                                        </Storyboard>
                                    </BeginStoryboard>
                                </Trigger.EnterActions>
                                <Trigger.ExitActions>
                                    <BeginStoryboard>
                                        <Storyboard>
                                            <ColorAnimation Storyboard.TargetName="Label"
                                                            Storyboard.TargetProperty="(TextBlock.Foreground).(SolidColorBrush.Color)"
                                                            To="#5B6270" Duration="0:0:0.26">
                                                <ColorAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                                    <SineEase EasingMode="EaseInOut" />
                                                </ColorAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                            </ColorAnimation>
                                        </Storyboard>
                                    </BeginStoryboard>
                                </Trigger.ExitActions>
                            </Trigger>

                            <!-- Which glyph this segment carries. -->
                            <Trigger Property="Tag" Value="Multi">
                                <Setter TargetName="SingleGlyph" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed" />
                                <Setter TargetName="MultiGlyph" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible" />
                            </Trigger>

                            <!-- Icon slot for the "Single" side: opens when chosen, closes when not. -->
                            <MultiTrigger>
                                <MultiTrigger.Conditions>
                                    <Condition Property="IsChecked" Value="True" />
                                    <Condition Property="Tag" Value="Single" />
                                </MultiTrigger.Conditions>
                                <MultiTrigger.EnterActions>
                                    <BeginStoryboard>
                                        <Storyboard>
                                            <DoubleAnimation Storyboard.TargetName="IconSlot" Storyboard.TargetProperty="Width"
                                                             To="25" Duration="0:0:0.34">
                                                <DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                                    <CubicEase EasingMode="EaseInOut" />
                                                </DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                            </DoubleAnimation>
                                            <DoubleAnimation Storyboard.TargetName="IconSlot" Storyboard.TargetProperty="Opacity"
                                                             To="1" Duration="0:0:0.3" BeginTime="0:0:0.08">
                                                <DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                                    <CubicEase EasingMode="EaseInOut" />
                                                </DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                            </DoubleAnimation>
                                        </Storyboard>
                                    </BeginStoryboard>
                                </MultiTrigger.EnterActions>
                                <MultiTrigger.ExitActions>
                                    <BeginStoryboard>
                                        <Storyboard>
                                            <DoubleAnimation Storyboard.TargetName="IconSlot" Storyboard.TargetProperty="Width"
                                                             To="0" Duration="0:0:0.3">
                                                <DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                                    <CubicEase EasingMode="EaseInOut" />
                                                </DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                            </DoubleAnimation>
                                            <DoubleAnimation Storyboard.TargetName="IconSlot" Storyboard.TargetProperty="Opacity"
                                                             To="0" Duration="0:0:0.18">
                                                <DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                                    <CubicEase EasingMode="EaseInOut" />
                                                </DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                            </DoubleAnimation>
                                        </Storyboard>
                                    </BeginStoryboard>
                                </MultiTrigger.ExitActions>
                            </MultiTrigger>

                            <!-- Icon slot for the "Multi" side: opens when chosen, closes when not. -->
                            <MultiTrigger>
                                <MultiTrigger.Conditions>
                                    <Condition Property="IsChecked" Value="True" />
                                    <Condition Property="Tag" Value="Multi" />
                                </MultiTrigger.Conditions>
                                <MultiTrigger.EnterActions>
                                    <BeginStoryboard>
                                        <Storyboard>
                                            <DoubleAnimation Storyboard.TargetName="IconSlot" Storyboard.TargetProperty="Width"
                                                             To="35" Duration="0:0:0.34">
                                                <DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                                    <CubicEase EasingMode="EaseInOut" />
                                                </DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                            </DoubleAnimation>
                                            <DoubleAnimation Storyboard.TargetName="IconSlot" Storyboard.TargetProperty="Opacity"
                                                             To="1" Duration="0:0:0.3" BeginTime="0:0:0.08">
                                                <DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                                    <CubicEase EasingMode="EaseInOut" />
                                                </DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                            </DoubleAnimation>
                                            <DoubleAnimation Storyboard.TargetName="FanLeft" Storyboard.TargetProperty="(UIElement.RenderTransform).(TransformGroup.Children)[0].(RotateTransform.Angle)"
                                                             To="-20" Duration="0:0:0.46" BeginTime="0:0:0.1">
                                                <DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                                    <CubicEase EasingMode="EaseInOut" />
                                                </DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                            </DoubleAnimation>
                                            <DoubleAnimation Storyboard.TargetName="FanLeft" Storyboard.TargetProperty="(UIElement.RenderTransform).(TransformGroup.Children)[1].(TranslateTransform.X)"
                                                             To="-2.5" Duration="0:0:0.46" BeginTime="0:0:0.1">
                                                <DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                                    <CubicEase EasingMode="EaseInOut" />
                                                </DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                            </DoubleAnimation>
                                            <DoubleAnimation Storyboard.TargetName="FanRight" Storyboard.TargetProperty="(UIElement.RenderTransform).(TransformGroup.Children)[0].(RotateTransform.Angle)"
                                                             To="20" Duration="0:0:0.46" BeginTime="0:0:0.1">
                                                <DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                                    <CubicEase EasingMode="EaseInOut" />
                                                </DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                            </DoubleAnimation>
                                            <DoubleAnimation Storyboard.TargetName="FanRight" Storyboard.TargetProperty="(UIElement.RenderTransform).(TransformGroup.Children)[1].(TranslateTransform.X)"
                                                             To="2.5" Duration="0:0:0.46" BeginTime="0:0:0.1">
                                                <DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                                    <CubicEase EasingMode="EaseInOut" />
                                                </DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                            </DoubleAnimation>
                                        </Storyboard>
                                    </BeginStoryboard>
                                </MultiTrigger.EnterActions>
                                <MultiTrigger.ExitActions>
                                    <BeginStoryboard>
                                        <Storyboard>
                                            <DoubleAnimation Storyboard.TargetName="IconSlot" Storyboard.TargetProperty="Width"
                                                             To="0" Duration="0:0:0.3">
                                                <DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                                    <CubicEase EasingMode="EaseInOut" />
                                                </DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                            </DoubleAnimation>
                                            <DoubleAnimation Storyboard.TargetName="IconSlot" Storyboard.TargetProperty="Opacity"
                                                             To="0" Duration="0:0:0.18">
                                                <DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                                    <CubicEase EasingMode="EaseInOut" />
                                                </DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                            </DoubleAnimation>
                                            <DoubleAnimation Storyboard.TargetName="FanLeft" Storyboard.TargetProperty="(UIElement.RenderTransform).(TransformGroup.Children)[0].(RotateTransform.Angle)"
                                                             To="0" Duration="0:0:0.24">
                                                <DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                                    <CubicEase EasingMode="EaseInOut" />
                                                </DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                            </DoubleAnimation>
                                            <DoubleAnimation Storyboard.TargetName="FanLeft" Storyboard.TargetProperty="(UIElement.RenderTransform).(TransformGroup.Children)[1].(TranslateTransform.X)"
                                                             To="0" Duration="0:0:0.24">
                                                <DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                                    <CubicEase EasingMode="EaseInOut" />
                                                </DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                            </DoubleAnimation>
                                            <DoubleAnimation Storyboard.TargetName="FanRight" Storyboard.TargetProperty="(UIElement.RenderTransform).(TransformGroup.Children)[0].(RotateTransform.Angle)"
                                                             To="0" Duration="0:0:0.24">
                                                <DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                                    <CubicEase EasingMode="EaseInOut" />
                                                </DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                            </DoubleAnimation>
                                            <DoubleAnimation Storyboard.TargetName="FanRight" Storyboard.TargetProperty="(UIElement.RenderTransform).(TransformGroup.Children)[1].(TranslateTransform.X)"
                                                             To="0" Duration="0:0:0.24">
                                                <DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                                    <CubicEase EasingMode="EaseInOut" />
                                                </DoubleAnimation.EasingFunction>
                                            </DoubleAnimation>
                                        </Storyboard>
                                    </BeginStoryboard>
                                </MultiTrigger.ExitActions>
                            </MultiTrigger>

                            <!-- Hover on the side that is not selected: a barely-there darker pill. -->
                            <MultiTrigger>
                                <MultiTrigger.Conditions>
                                    <Condition Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True" />
                                    <Condition Property="IsChecked" Value="False" />
                                </MultiTrigger.Conditions>
                                <Setter TargetName="Hit" Property="Background" Value="#0D0B0D12" />
                            </MultiTrigger>

                        </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                    </ControlTemplate>
                </Setter.Value>
            </Setter>
        </Style>

    </UserControl.Resources>

    <Grid>

        <!-- Track -->
        <Border CornerRadius="17" Background="#E8EAED" />

        <!--
            Aurora wash (same violet → pink → orange as GlowSweep). It always covers the whole track; the code-behind
            only raises and lowers its opacity and lets the colours drift a little towards the chosen side.
            To make it stronger or fainter, change the first two alpha digits of each stop.
        -->
        <Border x:Name="Wash" CornerRadius="17" Opacity="0" IsHitTestVisible="False">
            <Border.Background>
                <LinearGradientBrush StartPoint="0,0.5" EndPoint="1,0.5">
                    <LinearGradientBrush.RelativeTransform>
                        <TranslateTransform x:Name="WashShift" />
                    </LinearGradientBrush.RelativeTransform>
                    <GradientStop Color="#387C5CFF" Offset="0" />
                    <GradientStop Color="#40FF4FA3" Offset="0.5" />
                    <GradientStop Color="#38FF9248" Offset="1" />
                </LinearGradientBrush>
            </Border.Background>
        </Border>

        <!-- Thumb: positioned and sized by the code-behind (Canvas.Left + Width). -->
        <Canvas x:Name="ThumbLayer" Margin="3" IsHitTestVisible="False">
            <Border x:Name="Thumb" Height="28" Width="0" CornerRadius="14" Background="{StaticResource White}">
                <Border.Effect>
                    <DropShadowEffect Color="#0B0D12" Opacity="0.12" BlurRadius="3" ShadowDepth="1" Direction="270" />
                </Border.Effect>
            </Border>
        </Canvas>

        <!-- Segments -->
        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="3"
                    KeyboardNavigation.TabNavigation="Once"
                    KeyboardNavigation.DirectionalNavigation="None">
            <RadioButton x:Name="First" Style="{StaticResource Segment}" Tag="Single"
                         Content="{Binding FirstText, ElementName=Root}"
                         Checked="OnSegmentChecked" SizeChanged="OnSegmentSizeChanged" />
            <RadioButton x:Name="Second" Style="{StaticResource Segment}" Tag="Multi"
                         Content="{Binding SecondText, ElementName=Root}"
                         Checked="OnSegmentChecked" SizeChanged="OnSegmentSizeChanged" />
        </StackPanel>

    </Grid>
</UserControl>
